        <!-- SECTION 3: USER WORKFLOWS -->
        <section id="workflows">
            <h2>3️⃣ User Workflows</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
                Three primary user journeys define the platform's core interactions: patient consultation booking and participation, doctor consultation management, and administrative oversight.
            </p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px;">👤 Patient Workflow: Booking to Follow-up</h3>
            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">1</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Discovery & Registration</h4>
                    <p>Patient signs up via email/phone, completes profile, and creates family linked accounts (optional). Keycloak handles identity with DPDPA consent collection.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">2</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Doctor Search & Booking</h4>
                    <p>Patient browses doctors by specialty, checks availability, reads ratings, and books appointment. Automated reminder SMS/push sent 24h and 1h before slot.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">3</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Pre-Consultation Device Setup</h4>
                    <p>Patient pairs mobile app with BLE devices (BP monitor, ECG, glucose). System tests connection. Android app captures baseline vitals.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">4</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Live Consultation</h4>
                    <p>Patient joins Jitsi video room 5min before slot. Doctor sees live vital signs streamed over WebSocket (separate from Jitsi media). Patient can share readings in real-time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">5</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Prescription & Follow-up</h4>
                    <p>Doctor issues e-prescription in-app. Patient receives prescription via SMS/email. System triggers pharmacy delivery booking and refill reminders. Records auto-saved to FHIR + ABDM.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px;">👨‍⚕️ Doctor Workflow: Schedule to Reporting</h3>
            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">1</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Credentialing & Onboarding</h4>
                    <p>Doctor registers with NMC number. Admin verifies credentials via NMC database API. Doctor added to organization with role-based access control (RBAC).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">2</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Schedule Management</h4>
                    <p>Doctor sets availability calendar (recurring/one-time slots). System syncs to patient-facing calendar. Integration with Google Calendar (optional).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">3</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Live Consultation Interface</h4>
                    <p>Doctor joins Jitsi meeting. Dashboard shows patient vitals live in a panel (ECG waveform, BP trend, glucose, O2). AI Scribe listens and drafts notes in real-time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">4</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>E-Prescription & Decision Support</h4>
                    <p>Doctor issues medications from drug database (with drug interactions checked by AI). Attaches imaging/reports. System suggests dosages based on patient history and comorbidities (AI-assisted, doctor approves).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">5</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Reporting & Analytics</h4>
                    <p>Doctor dashboard shows daily consults, ratings, revenue. Reports exportable to PDF. Peer benchmarking anonymized. Compliance audit trail available.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px;">⚙️ Admin Workflow: Oversight & Control</h3>
            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">1</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Organization Setup</h4>
                    <p>Super-admin creates organization (clinic/hospital), sets billing model (per-consult / subscription), configures branding. Assigns org admins.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">2</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Doctor & Patient Management</h4>
                    <p>Org admin adds doctors (bulk upload CSV), verifies NMC certs, assigns specialties/departments. Manages patient access rules (age restrictions, referral gates).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">3</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Compliance Monitoring</h4>
                    <p>Admin dashboard shows DPDPA consent status per patient, audit logs of all record access, recording compliance (encryption verified). Generates compliance reports monthly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">4</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Billing & Revenue</h4>
                    <p>System tracks consults, applies pricing rules (org-specific), integrates with payment gateway. Admin sees revenue dashboards, invoices, and payout schedules.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-number">5</div>
                <div class="workflow-content">
                    <h4>Incident Response</h4>
                    <p>Admin receives alerts on failed consultations, payment errors, security events. Can view detailed logs, contact support, and escalate issues.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

